/-! Actual moving source-pole Gauss preparations carry absolute nativeY charge
-1, their charge matrix on the eight rest states is minus the generated Gram,
and the same unit grade-zero states consume the complete resolvent Ward with
all response retained. Nothing here selects an electromagnetic mode, an
electron species or a Thomson amplitude, and no spectral-label continuity,
stationarity or label limits are assumed: every statement is pointwise in the
momentum and uses the entire eight-state common carrier. -/
set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 2200000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 200000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
